sequenceDiagram
    participant A as A (central manager)
    participant Bp as B (peripheral manager)
    participant Bc as B (central manager)
    participant C as C (peripheral manager)

    Note over Bp,Bc: B is peripheral to A and central to C
    Bc->>Bc: distance(C) within threshold, role central
    Bc->>Bc: send(to C)
    Bc->>C: encrypted payload
    Note over Bp: ExchangeSession calls peripheral.declineAll()
    Bp->>Bp: acceptsPeers = false, stopAdvertising
    Bp-->>A: notify declined
    Bp->>Bp: dropPeer(A)
    A->>A: handleDecline(B), B not selected, dropPeer(B)
    Note over A: A keeps ranging C
